// Phase 4 tests: CPlayer (techs, bonuses, score inputs, fog of war, radar),
// CPlayerKI (influence map, cadence, squads) and CKISquad.
//
// Expected values are either computed by hand from the decompiled original
// (noted at each check) or come from the original engine itself:
// tests/players_oracle_data.h is generated by tools/emu/ai_oracle.py, which
// runs the original's functions under emulation on a freshly started
// skirmish (same map, players and options as loadGame below) and records
// their inputs and results.
